		(property "ReviewNote" "JST SH 1.0 mm 3-pin side-entry header (SM03B-SRSS-TB) for an off-the-shelf 3-wire protected LiPo with a JST SH 3P (SHR-03V-S) plug: 1 PACK_P red, 2 GND black, 3 PACK_NTC white/yellow (pack internal NTC, referenced to pack negative). No polarity standard exists: order packs with this pinout and check before mating. 1 A per contact. Replaces the 2026-11-18 solder lands."
